    "limitations": "These two source-class substitutions are explicit analytical counterfactuals using the original Gura example data and coefficients. They do not estimate an Upper Savannah intervention. Applicability depends on the actual observed class-5 footprint, original grid and selected model support. Original classes 8 and 19 must be present in the retained coefficient profile. Field validation and a regional parameter review remain separate scientific activities."
